{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260627_154420_p77_b27", "persona_id": "db:77", "outcome": "FOLLOW_UP", "content": "1. 面对技术参数询问，必须提供具体数字或官方报告，不能建议“看实际表现”或“查官网”。", "difficulty_rating": 8, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260627_154708"}
